    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "iMOVE are delighted to present 27 Parkside Drive, a beautifully presented three-bedroom home situated within the highly sought-after Parkside development just off the Malahide Road.\r\n\r\nBright, modern and finished to an excellent standard throughout, this attractive property offers generously proportioned accommodation complemented by a private rear garden and off-street parking. The house has been carefully maintained and is presented in walk-in condition, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, young families or anyone seeking a contemporary home in a well-connected location.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with guest WC, a spacious living room and an impressive open-plan kitchen and dining area overlooking the rear garden. The kitchen features an excellent range of fitted units, integrated appliances, generous worktop space and a breakfast bar, while glazed doors provide direct access to the garden and allow natural light to fill the room.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a generous principal bedroom with fitted wardrobes and en-suite shower room. A stylish family bathroom completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nOutside, the enclosed rear garden provides an ideal space for outdoor dining, entertaining and family life. To the front, there is convenient off-street parking.\r\n\r\nParkside is a modern and increasingly popular residential development located beside the award-winning Father Collins Park. The property enjoys easy access to a wide range of shops, schools, cafés, sporting facilities and recreational amenities. Clongriffin DART station is within easy reach, while numerous bus routes and the nearby M50, M1 and Malahide Road provide excellent connections to Dublin city centre, Dublin Airport and the surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nNo. 27 combines a bright contemporary interior, practical family accommodation and a superb location. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Features:\r\n\r\nBeautifully presented three-bedroom home\r\nSpacious and light-filled accommodation\r\nModern fitted kitchen with integrated appliances\r\nOpen-plan kitchen and dining area\r\nPrincipal bedroom with en-suite\r\nGuest WC and family bathroom\r\nFitted wardrobes\r\nPrivate enclosed rear garden\r\nOff-street parking\r\nPresented in walk-in condition\r\nLocated beside Father Collins Park\r\nConvenient to Clongriffin DART station\r\nExcellent access to the M1, M50 and Dublin Airport"
      },
      {
